    "coil": {
      "description": "winding up. Every part gathers along its own tangent rather than along the canvas, so the body concertinas into itself instead of squashing sideways: the tail travels furthest and the shoulders barely move, the plates fatten hardest where the pile-up is worst, and the head draws back down its own axis and takes the claws, the antennae and the organ with it. Held on the final frame, because the release is the dash.",
